  "prefLabel": "Rev 1405.04 Record Retention",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1405.04 Record Retention. A taxpayer shall keep such records as might be necessary to determine the amount of its UPT liability for:\n\n(a) The period of at least 3 years; or\n\n(b) Until any litigation or prosecution under RSA 83-F is finally determined.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev1400) #9841, eff 12-23-10; ss by #12706, eff 1-8-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev1400.html"
